"revokeSessionToken.button","errorNoSessions.title","errorNoSessions.desc","embeddedt, taumc and contributors","LGPL-3.0","Faster chunk rendering, based on Sodium for Minecraft 1.12. Draws the world with far fewer draw calls.","Entity Culling","Treasure Client, inspired by tr7zw","Built in","Skips drawing mobs, chests, signs and banners that are hidden behind solid blocks.","Krypton","Treasure Client, inspired by astei","Faster packet reading: numbers in packets are read straight from the packet\'s bytes, and text is decoded where it is instead of being copied out first. Same results, less work for every packet.",
"krypton","C2ME","Treasure Client, inspired by ishland","Smoother chunk loading: when a server sends a big burst of chunks and entities (like joining a game), about 8 ms of it is handled per tick instead of all at once, so the world loads in over a few ticks without a freeze. Singleplayer world generation also uses faster noise math (same worlds).","Particle Core","Treasure Client, inspired by fzzyhmstrs","Cheaper particles: far away particles move without checking for blocks, still particles skip the check, and at most 2048 of each kind are kept. Also fixes particles never landing on the ground.",
"Enhanced Block Entities","FoundationGames","Draws chests, ender chests and beds as part of the world instead of one by one every frame. Chests switch back while their lid moves.","FerriteCore","Treasure Client, inspired by malte0811","Block states stop keeping their own property map: values are read from their place in a shared grid, which is faster than a map lookup and saves one map per block state.","ferritecore","No Chat Lag","Treasure Client, inspired by noahvdaa","No stutter from busy chat: each chat line\'s colored text is worked out once instead of every frame, and logging new messages no longer runs slow text patterns.",
"nochatlag","FoamFix","Treasure Client, inspired by asie","Less memory and a faster start: block states share one compact lookup instead of a table each, and identical model faces are stored once.","foamfix","Treasure Client, inspired by Speiger","Less memory: after textures load, frees the leftover pixel copies of every texture that never animates.","texfix","CensoredASM","Treasure Client, inspired by Rongmario","Less memory and faster lookups: one shared copy of each repeated name (blocks, items, textures, NBT tags), better block position hashing, and no forced memory cleanup when joining a world.",
"censoredasm","BetterFps","Treasure Client, inspired by Guichaguri","Faster sine and cosine math from a small table (the same numbers as OptiFine\'s Fast Math, so anticheats accept it), and hoppers with a solid block on top stop searching for dropped items.","Dynamic Resolution","Treasure Client","When frames get slow from drawing, like when your device heats up, the world is drawn at a slightly lower resolution so the graphics chip has less to do. It goes back up once things are smooth again. Off by default. It never goes below 70% or below your own Render Resolution setting, and it ignores lag that comes from the server.",
"dynResOn","AI Improvements","Treasure Client, inspired by QueenOfMissiles","Mobs reuse their last head-turn angles while what they look at hasn\'t moved, skipping costly math. Mobs only run in singleplayer, so this speeds up singleplayer worlds.","aiimprove","Celeritas Extra","Sumire-Labs","Extra switches for animations, particles, sky, weather, item frames, armor stands, paintings, beacon beams, enchanting books, pistons and toasts. Set them with the gear in Treasure Settings.","Celeritas Leaf Culling","Karnatour (fork of Sodium Leaf Culling)",
"MIT","With fancy leaves, skips leaf faces hidden inside trees. Pick Hollow, Solid Aggressive or Solid in Treasure Settings.","Lithium","CaffeineMC","Faster collisions, chunk lookups and block entity lists, with the same results. Also speeds up singleplayer.","ImmediatelyFast","RaphiMC","Fewer draw calls for the HUD: hearts, hunger, armor and hotbar pieces that share a texture are drawn together in one go, and the HUD is drawn straight to the screen instead of through an extra full-screen image. Also cheaper name labels and signs, and no sign text past 32 blocks.",
"Dynamic FPS","juliand665","Drops to 10 FPS while another window is focused, so the game doesn\'t heat up your device in the background.","Memory Saver","Stops the idle singleplayer engine while you\'re on a server and frees unused sounds after 2 minutes instead of 10.","VanillaFix","DimensionalDevelopment","Recovers from crashes instead of closing the game, and fixes Minecraft bugs (menus in portals, camera in grass, a memory leak).","ViaVersion support","Shows modern 1.13+ blocks, items and entities on servers that send them.",
